:''See also: [[Artifact Spot]]''
A '''Seed Spot''' is a tile that is guaranteed to provide 2-3 seeds when dug up with a [[Hoes|Hoe]] (other tools do not work). Daily [[luck]] influences the number of seeds obtained.<ref name="digspot" /> Seed Spots can be found in various tillable (but fallow) tiles on maps all over Stardew Valley (including [[Ginger Island]]). They have a 16.6% chance to spawn instead of [[Artifact Spot]]s in certain locations.<ref name="spawnspot" />

When dug up, the provided seed depends on the current date.
